    ``length-1`` of the axis), but may also be used with a boolean
    array.

    Allowed inputs are:

    - An integer, e.g. ``5``.
    - A list or array of integers, e.g. ``[4, 3, 0]``.
    - A slice object with ints, e.g. ``1:7``.
    - A boolean array.

